{
    "id": "rover_meets_lucy",
    "title": "Northern Village — Rover meets Lucy",
    "settings": {
    "background": null,
    "bgm": null,
    "autoPlay": false
    },
    "lines": [
    {
    "id": "line_001",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "text": "...That's strange."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_002",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "text": "The houses are still standing, but the streets are empty."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_003",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lucy",
    "text": "Hey! You shouldn't be here!"
    },
    {
    "id": "line_004",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "text": "Easy. I'm not looking for trouble."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_005",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "text": "What happened to everyone? This place looks abandoned."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_006",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lucy",
    "text": "Most of the villagers left yesterday."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_007",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lucy",
    "text": "The monsters around the mountain have been acting strangely for days. Louder. More aggressive. Like they're gathering for something."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_008",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "text": "So the mana fluctuation wasn't my imagination."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_009",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lucy",
    "text": "You can sense that sort of thing?"
    },
    {
    "id": "line_010",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "text": "Enough to know something's wrong."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_011",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "text": "If the danger is real, why haven't you left too?"
    },
    {
    "id": "line_012",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lucy",
    "text": "Some people couldn't leave in time."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_013",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lucy",
    "text": "And some of us chose to stay."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_014",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "text": "Chosen to stay?"
    },
    {
    "id": "line_015",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lucy",
    "text": "This is our home. If we all run, there may not be anything left to come back to."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_016",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lucy",
    "text": "A few hunters and volunteers are preparing defenses near the outskirts."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_017",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lucy",
    "text": "We're not soldiers. But we'll protect what we can."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_018",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "text": "That's a heavy burden for a handful of villagers."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_019",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lucy",
    "text": "Maybe."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_020",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lucy",
    "text": "But waiting for someone else to save us doesn't feel much safer."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_021",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "text": "...Fair enough."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_022",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "text": "Then you're not facing this alone."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_023",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lucy",
    "text": "You mean..."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_024",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "text": "I'll help defend the village."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_025",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Lucy",
    "text": "Really? We could use all the help we can get."
    },
    {
    "id": "line_026",
    "type": "line",
    "speakerName": "Rover",
    "text": "Let's deal with the monsters first. We can talk afterward."
    }
    ]
    }